      "en": "The LORD appeared to Solomon the second time, as he had appeared to him at Gibeon.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 전에 기브온에서 나타나심 같이 다시 솔로몬에게 나타나사",
      "source_text_hash": "31553d311f55d2ef0f374c2d9a6c48033fa9ade0134d0005e65ace3140ffd508",
      "translation_text_hash": "dfb77b8c091824f578778a9cd6c2303d38b7ea8c56a5c6eeee155b7c5c05cdd7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 전에 기브온에서 나타나심 같이 다시 솔로몬에게 나타나사"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "dfb77b8c091824f578778a9cd6c2303d38b7ea8c56a5c6eeee155b7c5c05cdd7"
      ]
