      "en": "all the storage cities that Solomon had, the cities for his chariots, the cities for his horsemen, and that which Solomon desired to build for his pleasure in Jerusalem, and in Lebanon, and in all the land of his dominion.",
      "ko": "자기에게 있는 모든 국고성과 병거성들과 마병의 성들을 건축하고 솔로몬이 또 예루살렘과 레바논과 그 다스리는 온 땅에 건축하고자 하던 것을 다 건축하였는데",
      "source_text_hash": "001034f940738e0e791970df0bc48825e99dfd36377d67e8673314c8b3e8363e",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe960ac15a24b195887359aece61554a7762e977e50086ce48b475898343983b",
