      "en": "their children who were left after them in the land, whom the children of Israel were not able utterly to destroy—of them Solomon raised a levy of bondservants to this day.",
      "ko": "곧 이스라엘 자손이 다 멸하지 못하므로 그 땅에 남아 있는 그 자손들을 솔로몬이 노예로 역군을 삼아 오늘까지 이르렀으되",
      "source_text_hash": "ef9c9a01cc0aea4b5847ec986833ac505ed7095ab08b8d50127c71d8bdab35ec",
      "translation_text_hash": "2bad110de9b602afb437e11d47535d0186347df57e25b6eb301018999ebb10ec",
